File: internal/parser/planparserv2/Plan.g4
Lines 139, 152:

Identifier: Nondigit (Nondigit | Digit)*;
...
fragment Nondigit: [a-zA-Z_];

This grammar rule defines that valid identifiers MUST start with a letter (a-zA-Z) or underscore (_), NOT with a digit.

